= Gregorio Marañón

Gregorio Marañón is Spain's most eminent physician and endocrinologist, a founder of the Agrupación al Servicio de la República, and a rare public voice for the rights of sexual minorities and the reform of medicine and science. [? if homosexual_rights: He carries considerable weight now that the Republic has moved on the rights of sexual minorities. ?]


